e parent is not all mechanism: the parent lost 4 samples to the provider's non-retryable content filter and this run lost 1, so roughly 3 of the +6 correct samples over N5 are provider flakiness; the mechanism's own contribution is the 2 in-run flips at no loss. Model calls per sample rise as in N5 (2.00 -> 3.00 LawBench, 2.18 -> 3.00 Symptom2Disease, 3.35 -> 4.20 USPTO). The run resumed an interrupted first attempt in the same output directory (25/59/55 samples reused, all of them from this same tree). What the family costs is now measurable for later nodes: the wrong answers whose entries are not listed strings and not rewritable are dominated by two groups the key cannot reach -- charges the memory never writes and the abridged facts do not carry, and set-omission samples whose extra charges have no support in the facts."}

